The file `records.json` in this directory contains OCMF records and public keys
extracted from the test resources of the S.A.F.E. Transparenzsoftware:

    https://github.com/SAFE-eV/transparenzsoftware
    commit def928b9ec5fee05b7b6815b343df65e77e99be8
    src/test/resources/**/*.xml

